#*
fetch an http request
the default Content-Type is json

examples:
```revo
http.fetch(:get, "https://example.com", {})
http.fetch(:post, "https://example.com", {
	body = { foo = "bar" }
})
```
*#
pub declare http.fetch = fn(method: :get | :post | :put | :delete | :head | :options | :patch | :trace, url: any, opts: table) -> !string

